# Music OS (private routes)

Private admin at `/studio`, `/songs`, `/skills`, `/report`.
As-built: @context/domains/music-os.md · Data: @context/data-model.md

**Auth:** `/login` + middleware (httpOnly cookie, `MUSIC_OS_PASSWORD`, ~1 year). WeekOS pattern.
No sign-up, email, or OAuth.

**`/studio`:** Riyaz + full-session Stand (anchor → practice → reflect) + AI Coach.
**`/songs`:** Drift lists + notebooks. **`/skills`:** guitar/vocal lab + voice profile.
**`/report`:** monthly look-back. `/releases` → `/songs`, `/journey` → `/report`, `/vocal` → Skills vocal tab.

Stages are states, not deadlines. No habit-tracker scores. Coach: @context/domains/coach.md
